sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Sender
  participant P1 as Receiver
  participant P2 as Inbox DB
  participant P3 as Worker
  P0->>P1: Signed raw event with ID
  P1->>P2: Verify then commit inbox event
  P2->>P1: Durable acceptance
  P1-->>P0: Response lost
  P0->>P1: Retry same signed event ID
  P1->>P2: Check duplicate ID
  P2->>P1: Existing accepted event
  P1->>P0: Successful acknowledgment
  P2->>P3: Process accepted work idempotently
